# Intermediate single-model panels that the grid figures are composed from (~4 MB, 28
# files). Pure regenerable output: every one of them is embedded in a committed grid in
# figures/, and `make_topology_figures.py` recreates them in ~2 min. The root .gitignore
# un-ignores experiments/figures_paper/**/*.png (line 67), so they would otherwise be
# tracked; this re-ignores just the intermediates. The FINAL figures under figures/ stay
# tracked.
data/panels/
